# Naver source smoke requests.
# Direct Naver calls verify credentials/API availability.
# App calls verify PostForge source adapters, mapping, persistence, and metrics.
# Keep real Naver credentials and access tokens in local IDE environment variables.

@appBaseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@naverBaseUrl = https://openapi.naver.com
@naverClientId = paste-naver-search-client-id-here
@naverClientSecret = paste-naver-search-client-secret-here
@userAccessToken = paste-user-access-token-here
@adminAccessToken = paste-admin-access-token-here
@monitoringUsername = monitor
@monitoringPassword = monitor-secret

### Direct Naver Shopping search: verify external API and credentials
GET {{naverBaseUrl}}/v1/search/shop.json?query=무선%20키보드&display=5&start=1&sort=sim&exclude=used:rental:cbshop
X-Naver-Client-Id: {{naverClientId}}
X-Naver-Client-Secret: {{naverClientSecret}}

### Direct Naver News search: verify external API and credentials
GET {{naverBaseUrl}}/v1/search/news.json?query=아이폰%20출시&display=5&start=1&sort=date
X-Naver-Client-Id: {{naverClientId}}
X-Naver-Client-Secret: {{naverClientSecret}}

### App price check: USER/ADMIN, reads Naver Shopping when NAVER_SHOPPING_ENABLED=true
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/api/price-checks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userAccessToken}}

{
  "keyword": "무선 키보드",
  "basePrice": 79000,
  "shippingFee": 3000,
  "discountAmount": 5000,
  "finalPaidPrice": 77000
}

### App manual product collection: ADMIN, persists collection job/raw products
# Requires NAVER_SHOPPING_ENABLED=true and NAVER_SEARCH_CLIENT_ID/NAVER_SEARCH_CLIENT_SECRET.
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/api/admin/collection-jobs/manual
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "source": "NAVER",
  "keyword": "무선 키보드",
  "displayCount": 5
}

### App manual news document collection: ADMIN, fetches Naver News and stores document chunks/embeddings
# Requires NAVER_NEWS_ENABLED=true and NAVER_SEARCH_CLIENT_ID/NAVER_SEARCH_CLIENT_SECRET.
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/api/admin/news-documents/manual
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "keyword": "아이폰 출시",
  "displayCount": 5,
  "topics": [
    "출시",
    "가격",
    "예약판매"
  ]
}

### App manual launch-news posting: ADMIN, may create PRODUCT_LAUNCH_NEWS posts
# Use carefully: this can create posts after Naver News gate + AI draft generation.
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/api/admin/launch-news/manual
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "keyword": "아이폰 출시",
  "displayCount": 5,
  "dailyCap": 1,
  "topics": [
    "출시",
    "공식 발표"
  ]
}

### App Naver source metrics: verify external_naver_fetch_* metrics
GET {{appBaseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
Authorization: Basic {{monitoringUsername}} {{monitoringPassword}}
